# ============================================================
# REQUIRED: Supabase Auth Settings
# ============================================================
# 1. Go to Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > URL Configuration
# 2. Set Site URL to your production domain (e.g., https://radiantschool.vercel.app)
# 3. Add the following Redirect URLs:
#    - https://radiantschool.vercel.app/auth/callback
#    - https://radiantschool.vercel.app/reset-password
#
# 4. Go to Authentication > Providers > Google
#    - Enable Google auth
#    - Add your Google OAuth Client ID and Secret
#    - Add redirect URL: https://kaoxcbqhuwhtadpgccjp.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#
# 5. Go to Authentication > Email Templates
#    - Customize "Confirm signup" and "Reset password" emails
#    - Change {{ .ConfirmationURL }} to {{ .SiteURL }}?token_hash={{ .TokenHash }}&type=email
#    - This ensures the API route handles email confirmations and password resets
